he family conservatively. An `Entries` request retains its exact cumulative resource refusal instead of silently substituting another dependency policy. Positive-reciprocal kernel scratch has the scoped ticket inventory described above; the separate deterministic solve inventory covers RHS, certificate, restoration and recovery arrays. The solve-owned sensitivity and moment arrays and the native LC phasor arrays also have scoped inventories. The general-statistics inventory covers pre-binding parameter capture, generic statistical executors and standalone cross-covariance; other private kernels retain separate obligations.

